app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: imasmiṃ yante Vulkan-loader natthi; tasmā tena kiñci chāyārūpaṃ racituṃ na sakkā.\n\nSchist Vulkan-dvāraṃ chāyārūpaṃ racati, `libvulkan.so.1` ca na patiṭṭhāpitaṃ.\nLoader ceva driver ca ubho avassakā:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: imassa session-assa niddiṭṭho Vulkan-driver tattha natthi.\n\n{var} ṭhapitaṃ; tassa ṭhapanaṃ loader-assa driver-gavesanaṃ vaḍḍhetuṃ na, api tu taṃ apanetvā sayameva patiṭṭhāti. Tasmā imā avijjamānā sañcikāyo sakala-driver-nāmāvali honti; kati pi driverā patiṭṭhāpitā hontu, imasmiṃ session-mhi sabbaṃ Vulkan-programaṃ driveraṃ na passati:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nTaṃ vijjamāna-manifestaṃ niddisāpetha—patiṭṭhāpitā driverā attano manifestāni /usr/share/vulkan/icd.d-mhi ṭhapenti—atha vā taṃ apanāmetvā loader-aṃ attano driveraṃ gavesituṃ detha.\nYadi config-sañcikā (Hyprland-assa `env =`, systemd environment.d drop-in, shell-profile) {var} ṭhapeti, vikati tassā sañcikāyaṃ kātabbā. Vikatiyā pubbe āraddhaprogramāni pāpuṇituṃ puna pavesitabbaṃ.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} {value}ti ṭhapitaṃ; taṃ loader-assa attano gavesanaṃ apanetvā patiṭṭhāti. Tesu koci manifest imassa yantassa na hoti ce, taṃ apanāmanaṃ paṭhamaṃ payogo hotu.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: Vulkan-driver na patiṭṭhāpito; tasmā tena kiñci chāyārūpaṃ racituṃ na sakkā.\n\nSchist Vulkan-dvāraṃ chāyārūpaṃ racati. Loader patiṭṭhāpito, driver pana tena na ñāpito—yāsu dvīsu ṭhānesu gavesīyati tesu ekasmim-pi koci attānaṃ na likhāpesi:\n\n{dirs}\n\nLoader driverehi visuṃ āgacchati; tasmā pāyena ekameva aladdha-package avassakaṃ.\n\nImassa yantassa GPU-anurūpaṃ patiṭṭhāpetha:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nNVIDIA-ya sāmika-driver attano driveraṃ āharati (Arch-mhi `nvidia-utils`, Debian-mhi `nvidia-driver`). Virtual-yante vā yattha GPU-driver patiṭṭhāpetuṃ natthi tattha software-rasteriser kammaṃ karoti: Arch-mhi `vulkan-swrast`, aññattha `mesa-vulkan-drivers`-assa bhāgo. So dandho, atha kho ārabhati.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: Vulkan-driver patiṭṭhāpito, chāyārūparacanatthāya pana upakaraṇaṃ na deti.\n\nDriver imaṃ GPU na saṅgaṇheyya, vā taṃ pāpuṇituṃ na sakkuṇeyya—SSH-upari vā container-anto vā /dev/dri bahulaṃ aladdhaṃ hoti. `vulkaninfo --summary` loader-ena diṭṭhaṃ vadati.\n\nImasmiṃ yante GPU natthi ce software-rasteriser GPU vināpi chāyārūpaṃ racati: Arch-mhi `vulkan-swrast`, Debian-Fedora-mhi `mesa-vulkan-drivers`-assa bhāgo.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Schist tathāpi ārabhetvā yathāsakaṃ vipajjituṃ detukāmo ce, {var}=1 ṭhapetha.
